Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：终于开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华 半决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的对手是鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是鲨鱼被托隆操控了内心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}认定我是妹妹的敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.45,0:00:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快醒醒 鲨鱼。你是被骗了啊！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）鲨鱼的 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽什么的听都没听过啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽什么的那种东西见都没见过！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那到底是什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 那只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）那就是鲨鱼的 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.15,0:00:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）看起来好强啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多么可怕的怪兽啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.费卡)但是太棒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要得到。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)嘴上这么说……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在这时候 说不定在哪正高兴着呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 那也只是现在而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击咯咯咯咯鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊撕咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着要来了！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动鲨鱼龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗破坏怪兽时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量素材取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏的咯咯咯咯鬼的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到游马场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么把游马的怪兽召唤到场上？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.78,0:03:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了再攻击一次啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的生命值只剩900了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.71,0:03:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，只要再一次破坏隆隆隆幽灵就结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把隆隆隆幽灵、把游马咬碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就是游马输了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎…怎么会。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆幽灵和隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}互换位置了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的生命值也保持原样哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？为什么隆隆隆石人会！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是隆隆隆幽灵的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆幽灵在被特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤墓地里的隆隆隆石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 使用这个效果的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆幽灵会变成守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以即使被鲨鱼龙破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要受到的伤害是零！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.19,0:04:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…算你小子捡回一条命。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)漂亮的战术！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定是多亏了星光体啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)在战斗的是游马啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是那样喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.09,0:04:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还挺能干的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡只有用 No.卡才能打倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要获胜，九十九游马也
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能召唤 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个原版的化身！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，是霍普。不召唤霍普的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们就没有胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.35,0:04:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 我的场上只有隆隆隆石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是再来一只 同样等级4的怪兽的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.19,0:05:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 不是怪兽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别急 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能不急！ 得快点救他！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也会成为特隆的牺牲品！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快醒醒 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你的心中 还残留着真正的心的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。 和你最初的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.98,0:05:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我和铁男赌上卡组的战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 还和你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行过组队决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((废柴决斗者竟然……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.83,0:05:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你多少也成长了一些啊))
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听他这么说 我很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.07,0:05:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于 和你感觉心灵相通了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为了保护这家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和海马战斗 我也很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们 在决斗的过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不断加深着羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 无聊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么同伴什么羁绊我不知道{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西跟我没关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在驱动我的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有对你的复仇心!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}布拉博！ 好啊 好啊 太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我打倒你是为了给妹妹报仇 才在这里的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是为了什么而在这里的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.09,0:06:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是为了打倒我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别一直光耍嘴皮子了放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的回合已经开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然这样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就只能用决斗来传达心意了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把隆隆隆石人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从守备表示{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改为攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄金形态！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让守备表示的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成攻击表示的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到下次自己的回合为止变成两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这真是又耀眼又帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就是黄金燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在想什么啊 游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算把隆隆隆石人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.03,0:07:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强化了……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底也打不倒 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 就算打不倒 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也要正面撞上去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我的想法传达给鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 只能这么做了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击鲨鱼·德雷克！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨型加农炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 快醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我醒过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:07:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打中了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马这记超狠的一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.77,0:08:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)这样一来 游马和
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼的生命值 就以900持平了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.19,0:08:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是打不倒我的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想削我的生命值吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，这次一定要取你性命！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要为妹妹报仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生什么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身体在发光！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将海咬龙 鲨龙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材进行混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，CNo.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨龙·恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.48,0:09:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.69,0:09:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混、CNo.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.57,0:09:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于出来了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来局势就压倒性地对我不利…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动鲨鱼·龙·拜斯的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量素材取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中冠有鲨鱼之名的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择 尖鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力1600的数值
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从轰轰轰轰巨人的攻击力中减去！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧 尖鲨 撞上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量变化护壁！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡让轰轰轰轰巨人的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降600…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.67,0:10:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将鲨鱼·龙·拜斯的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}防住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 鲨鱼·龙·拜斯还有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.57,0:10:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 超量·单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.56,0:10:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就 再让你吃一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量·单元
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地的怪兽除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 选择双头鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这家伙的攻击力1200分
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降低咯咯咯咯雷姆的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}撞上去吧 双头鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 再次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动力量·变化·屏障的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将怪兽效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.76,0:11:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量·单元 还有1个！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 选择墓地的鲨鱼·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个攻击力2800的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}五神龙的攻击力降下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}防住它，力量变化护壁！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易才提升到3600的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果自己又把它降回到1800了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且游马的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经只剩900了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他到底知不知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的，鲨鱼龙恶霸和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}五神龙的攻击力差距是1000。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一击打中，就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！鲨鱼龙恶霸！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击五神龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)深渊混沌咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.67,0:12:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！半途破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为这个效果五神龙不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对我造成的伤害减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧，真是个难缠的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，在我下一个回合你会彻底坠入地狱。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多隆）没错，下一回合就结束了。彻底地。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候，我送给凌牙的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份礼物，就用那张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马将被全灭。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了，力量变化护壁。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的生命值还剩400。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这个回合做个了断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。我，我……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信我自己，和我的卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾了！我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的嘎嘎嘎魔法师和
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰轰轰轰魔像进行超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是现身之时！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.57,0:13:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货。事到如今才召唤出霍普{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2500是打不倒鲨鱼龙兽的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你能做的，就只有狼狈地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好自爆的觉悟冲上去而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普不会死。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No.也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想救你。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然我也不想输。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想在决斗狂欢节上夺冠，然后对托隆和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡狠狠地说上一句。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是就算赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以失去你 我更不愿意！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我要 我要…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管用什么手段都要救你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你从托隆的咒缚中解放出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧鲨鱼！ 希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击鲨鱼龙咬鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 结果什么手段都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是笨蛋只会一招的正面攻击吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看我把你打回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊混沌咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用一个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动霍普的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.07,0:14:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效一只怪兽的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效霍普的攻击…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是现在 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 邦兹·欧布·莱瓦尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在自己怪兽的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被无效的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这张卡装备到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行战斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走那只怪兽的控制权！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}附到我身上来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·德雷克·拜斯！离开鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到我这里来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马把 鲨鱼的 No.……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)夺走了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么做的话… 游马会？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺回来 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你真正的心！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.57,0:16:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((九十九游马 我记住你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再和我扯上关系了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.83,0:16:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场胜负就在决赛中分个高下。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不想看到啊～！))
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游… 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.47,0:16:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害我妹妹的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是游马》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《伤害我妹妹的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是特隆！》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我一直以来都被 No.们束缚着…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 很痛苦呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去 这次他就要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被 No.们吞噬了哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么办 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你从痛苦中拯救出来的他{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次却在痛苦着。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想救他吧，既然你也是同伴的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办才好……啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多隆）看来你想起来了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要用那张陷阱卡就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅达利翁·灾厄。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅达利翁·灾厄……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，再这样下去的话……！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多隆）没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙马上就会来救你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.97,0:17:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走了鲨鱼·龙·拜斯{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.51,0:17:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖放着的陷阱卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅达利翁·灾厄才能发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是，当自己的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.74,0:17:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被对方控制的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力在其以下的怪兽全部破坏掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，把鲨鱼龙·拜斯和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普破坏掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:17:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:17:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连霍普也！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来游马就能从 No.的咒缚中解脱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过要承受被破坏怪兽攻击力合计的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，5300的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你得吃下哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就是你赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我早就预想到会变成这样，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才把那张卡交给你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必杀的陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是霍普被破坏，星光体也……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么…… 有什么办法没有啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个！ 陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以把场上的永续陷阱解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这个的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能破坏羁绊·of·劲敌…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.75,0:18:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·龙·巴伊斯会变回鲨鱼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普和我都能得救。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但他会再次落入 No.众…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，会受特隆的支配。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，你要选哪边？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙？还是阿斯特拉尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆…！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你来决定，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.45,0:19:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这种状况下我什么都做不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是你的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己思考，自己决定。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事… 让我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你和鲨鱼之间做选择什么的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多隆)不快点救他的话 他会 越来越
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 动手吧 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动梅达利翁·灾祸{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·龙·拜斯也好 希望皇霍普也好…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 九十九游马一口气全部葬送掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选不了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选不了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为啊… 你和鲨鱼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说… 都是重要的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.81,0:20:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张盖牌… 我一开始…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.09,0:20:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法海洋雪之封印！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.37,0:20:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)将鲨鱼龙恶霸除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我作为那个代价
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到1000点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢…赢的人是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:20:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马选手…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}振作点 鲨鱼！ 喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 为了救我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.55,0:21:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 在决斗当中也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的声音 我一直都听得见。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那颗永不放弃的心…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有那炽热的斗志…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.41,0:21:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我从托隆手中救了出来…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.27,0:21:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒托隆… 是你的话 能做到…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.67,0:21:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是友情… 羁绊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.39,0:21:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底要妨碍我到什么地步才肯罢休啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了 无所谓……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马之后再慢慢收拾掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由我亲手来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的命 是被他救下的……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.05,0:21:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 不是我赢的……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是他把胜利让给了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 还托付了心意给我。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.23,0:22:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊……鲨鱼的心意也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部统统算上我一定要赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.39,0:22:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我燃起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.27,0:23:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.67,0:23:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.74,0:23:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.63,0:24:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.74,0:24:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.00,0:24:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
